interactive_graphs

This package is a Flutter port of Kuiver (https://github.com/justdeko/kuiver),
a Kotlin Multiplatform graph visualization library by Denis Koljada,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The graph model, the hierarchical and force-directed layout algorithms, the
edge geometry and the viewer behaviour follow Kuiver's design and were
re-implemented in Dart. The example app ports Kuiver's sample screens.
